      "message": "These will be visible in a lot of places, so I\u0027d call them something slightly more specific, like `SDB_OFFSET_INTERNAL_TEMP`. This would also be similar to the convention used above for Battery Status and Battery Capability.\n\nBonus points for something like\n```\nstruct pd_sdb {\n  uint8_t internal_temp;\n  uint8_t present_input;\n  uint8_t present_battery_input;\n  uint8_t event_flags;\n  enum pd_sdb_temperature_status temperature_status;\n  uint8_t power_status;\n};\n```\nBut we haven\u0027t done that broadly for message contents, so I\u0027ll call it a nit.",
